# Raw asset packs kept locally but never committed - too large, and the game
# only needs the trimmed subsets checked in beside them.
# TopDown Vehicles is 26,776 PNGs; public/assets/packs/topdown-vehicles/ holds
# the 88 sheets actually used (see src/game/packs/topDownVehicles.js).
public/assets/packs/TopDown Vehicles v1.17/
public/assets/packs/Harvest Sumer Free Ver. Pack/
public/assets/packs/Pixel 16 v2 village free/

# Raw AI-generated NPC reference sheets: baked-in titles/grid-lines/labels and
# solid white backgrounds, unusable as game sprites as-is (see
# src/game/packs/npcRealSprites.js's header). Salvaged, game-ready sheets are
# cropped from these by hand and committed under packs/npc/processed/ instead
# - only that subfolder is tracked, not the raw originals sitting beside it.
public/assets/packs/npc/*.png

# Same deal for the police battle reference sheets: white-background contact
# sheets with several sprites plus a text caption under each. The individual
# sprites cut out of them live in packs/police-battle/ (no space in the path,
# so they're usable as plain URLs) and that folder IS committed.
public/assets/packs/police fighting/

# packs/Lisa/ raw sources. Everything the game actually loads is generated
# from these into two committed subfolders - packs/Lisa/processed/ (the
# overworld walk sprite sheet) and packs/Lisa/portraits/ + packs/Lisa/scenes/
# (the interaction UI). The raws stay local: they're large full-res stills,
# and several are real press photographs rather than the AI-generated art the
# game uses, so they should not be redistributed with the repo.
public/assets/packs/Lisa/*.png
public/assets/packs/Lisa/Lisa no bg/
public/assets/packs/Lisa/Lisa w bg/
public/assets/packs/Lisa/Background/

# Same deal for packs/Warren/ and packs/Ince/ (WarrenModal.jsx/IncModal.jsx) -
# raw full-res AI-generated stills with a solid white background. Only the
# processed cutouts under portraits/ are committed; both reuse packs/Lisa/
# scenes/ for backdrops rather than needing their own.
public/assets/packs/Warren/*.png
public/assets/packs/Ince/*.png
